{"id":"yer-2rs-zwp","title":"[FUSE][Snap Adapter] Overview","description":"Operational view of the SNAP integration for both directions of the snap-adapter monorepo. Shared header: SNAP reachability, instance health and Cloud Run runtime. Adapter tab = the write path (Fuse -> SNAP record creation). Polling tab = the read path (snap-polling-service reads confirmations out of SNAP). Safety controls tab = the circuit breakers, concurrency and rate limits, and retry budget of both services.","author_handle":"harry.fitzgerald@gfsdeliver.com","author_name":"","layout_type":"ordered","url":"/dashboard/yer-2rs-zwp/fusesnap-adapter-overview","template_variables":[{"name":"env","prefix":"environment","available_values":[],"default":"*"},{"name":"snap_host","prefix":"snap_host","available_values":[],"default":"*"},{"name":"business","prefix":"businessid","available_values":[],"default":"*"}],"widgets":[{"id":6018626815107613,"definition":{"title":"SNAP at a Glance","show_title":true,"type":"group","layout_type":"ordered","widgets":[{"id":7497471235820706,"definition":{"title":"Confirmations Published (SNAP → Fuse)","title_size":"16","title_align":"left","type":"query_value","requests":[{"formulas":[{"formula":"q"}],"queries":[{"aggregator":"sum","data_source":"metrics","name":"q","query":"sum:fuse.confirmation.published{service:snap-polling-service,$env}.as_count()"}],"response_format":"scalar"}],"autoscale":true,"precision":0,"timeseries_background":{"type":"bars"}},"layout":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":2,"height":2}},{"id":2849596129338561,"definition":{"title":"Records Created (Fuse → SNAP)","title_size":"16","title_align":"left","type":"query_value","requests":[{"formulas":[{"formula":"q"}],"queries":[{"aggregator":"sum","data_source":"metrics","name":"q","query":"sum:snap.event_handled.success{$env}.as_count()"}],"response_format":"scalar"}],"autoscale":true,"precision":0,"timeseries_background":{"type":"bars"}},"layout":{"x":2,"y":0,"width":2,"height":2}},{"id":7292051920669296,